{"3652470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Just Madness: Earth Apocalypse 1979", "steam_appid": 3652470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/55316f5168beef338b90c66ed41c1a88.avif?t=1787139264\" width=612 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a radioactive wasteland ravaged by nuclear fallout, humanity has lost its mind. After a brutal ambush, Max manages to protect his wife, but his young daughter is torn away by a ruthless gang. Survival is no longer enough—now, it is about vengeance and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.poster.avif?t=1787139264\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.webm?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.mp4?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle extreme environments where daytime heat scorches and nighttime cold freezes. Manage your radiation levels, hunger, and thirst while hunting down those who took everything from you. In a world turned mad, you must find a reason to keep fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/2fed65680e582094464c7e3c3629c77b.poster.avif?t=1787139264\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/2fed65680e582094464c7e3c3629c77b.webm?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/2fed65680e582094464c7e3c3629c77b.mp4?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Perspective Freedom:</strong> Switch seamlessly between First-Person and Third-Person modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perilous Open World:</strong> Explore a vast, hostile wasteland filled with radioactive ruins and hidden dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice-Driven Narrative:</strong> Forge alliances or make deadly enemies—your decisions directly alter the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG Progression:</strong> Customize Max’s skills and attributes to match your specific playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Octane Combat &amp; Travel:</strong> Utilize devastating firearms and vehicular warfare to conquer the wasteland.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore Survival Mechanics:</strong> Manage scarce resources, fight off starvation, and prevent lethal radiation poisoning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/c2203874d790d3fa97057ff934d379d2.poster.avif?t=1787139264\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/c2203874d790d3fa97057ff934d379d2.webm?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/c2203874d790d3fa97057ff934d379d2.mp4?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Madness: Earth Apocalypse 1979</strong> blends survival, psychological horror, and dark drama into a brutal, unforgiving journey. Dive into the chaos. Will you survive the madness?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/55316f5168beef338b90c66ed41c1a88.avif?t=1787139264\" width=612 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a radioactive wasteland ravaged by nuclear fallout, humanity has lost its mind. After a brutal ambush, Max manages to protect his wife, but his young daughter is torn away by a ruthless gang. Survival is no longer enough—now, it is about vengeance and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.poster.avif?t=1787139264\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.webm?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652470/extras/320a6826982a96f8bbac7c58b5d38b71.mp4?t=1787139264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle extreme environments where daytime heat scorches and nighttime cold freezes. Manage your radiation levels, hunger, and thirst while hu